  "description": "LiteRetry is a lightweight, fluent, and flexible retry utility for .NET.\n\t\t\tIt provides automatic retries with support for exponential backoff, retry filters, retry hooks, cancellation tokens, and detailed retry context.\n\t\t\tIdeal for developers who want robust error handling without the complexity of larger frameworks.",
